  "description": "Runs the Shiny.AppDeviceBridge server in a .NET MAUI app: starts it with the app, restarts it on resume when the OS took its socket, and fills in the host version. Works on Android, iOS, Mac Catalyst, Windows, and the maui-labs macOS (AppKit) and Linux (GTK4) backends. Add Shiny.AppDeviceBridge.WebView to show a web app.",
